WEBVTT

00:07.056 --> 00:08.599
We made it to Venezia!

00:09.141 --> 00:10.642
Make room cause I'm diving in!

00:24.573 --> 00:26.741
Mista! Hurry up and
get out of the car!

00:34.417 --> 00:38.546
G-Giorno! You… Your body's already…

00:38.879 --> 00:41.339
I know I don't have to
tell you, Mista,

00:41.757 --> 00:45.010
our first priority is
getting you know what.

00:45.094 --> 00:47.971
Securing it
will secure our victory.

00:52.601 --> 00:54.311
<i>The disc is in there!</i>

00:54.645 --> 00:58.106
The vast amount of water will
slow down the freezing in the car.

00:58.274 --> 00:59.441
So there's no better time
to take a dip.

00:59.525 --> 01:01.401
I'm going to be fine… Get out now!

01:01.444 --> 01:03.112
Say no more, Giorno…

01:03.154 --> 01:05.156
But your definition of victory
needs some work!

01:05.489 --> 01:06.656
Destroying ice boy

01:06.699 --> 01:09.576
and hightailing it outta here
with disk in hand…

01:09.618 --> 01:10.827
That's how you do victory!

01:14.123 --> 01:16.667
You really think you can get away?!

01:22.965 --> 01:25.175
You're welcome
to have a dip, Mista!

01:25.259 --> 01:27.052
I'm willing to bet

01:27.136 --> 01:31.348
my ice can migrate faster than
you can doggy paddle!

01:32.183 --> 01:33.851
Merda…

01:33.893 --> 01:36.353
I guess I shouldn't have dumped
the car in here after all!

01:36.437 --> 01:40.441
This bastard's ice attacks are…
unbeatable!

01:51.577 --> 01:56.077
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

01:56.916 --> 02:00.377
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

02:02.171 --> 02:06.671
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

02:07.343 --> 02:11.180
<i>But I will never give in</i>

02:11.222 --> 02:15.722
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

02:23.025 --> 02:27.525
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

02:36.080 --> 02:40.580
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

02:42.044 --> 02:46.544
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

02:49.134 --> 02:52.262
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

02:52.346 --> 02:56.846
<i>Our battle against God
will keep raging on</i>

02:57.560 --> 03:02.060
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

03:11.657 --> 03:16.157
EPISODE 19
WHITE ICE

03:15.160 --> 03:16.641
Turn the car into a plant, Giorno!

03:17.997 --> 03:20.708
The hood isn't totally
covered in ice yet.

03:20.749 --> 03:24.461
Make some kind of plant out of it
while you still can!

03:28.257 --> 03:31.718
Trying to use vines as ropes, eh?

03:32.094 --> 03:34.137
Sorry, but that's a no!

03:37.600 --> 03:38.809
I-It's no use.

03:38.892 --> 03:40.560
If I want a fast grower like vines

03:40.603 --> 03:42.605
to make it all the way
to the banks,

03:42.646 --> 03:43.647
I'm going to need
some warmer temperatures.

03:43.981 --> 03:45.607
This harsh, subzero cold

03:45.649 --> 03:48.526
is too extreme for anything
other than tundra grass!

03:48.569 --> 03:51.655
Who said anything about getting
the vines to the bank, Giorno?

03:52.323 --> 03:53.866
This'll work just fine!

03:53.949 --> 03:55.450
Grass is just what
the doctor ordered!

03:55.826 --> 03:58.995
But I need more! More! More!

03:59.038 --> 04:01.498
If you wanna live,
grow me some grass!

04:01.665 --> 04:05.001
Grow like your life
depends on it, Giorno!

04:06.795 --> 04:08.087
Gotcha!

04:08.130 --> 04:10.966
Such a shame your vegetation
is too deficient to touch land!

04:11.342 --> 04:14.303
Fantastic, Giorno…
It finally froze!

04:14.345 --> 04:16.638
You just avoided disaster!

04:21.810 --> 04:25.688
Bastardo… He froze the grass
into a freakin' sled.

04:25.814 --> 04:28.608
He made an actual snowboard!

04:28.651 --> 04:29.902
Cazzo!

04:30.110 --> 04:33.071
<i>You think he's gonna let you off
that easy, Mista?</i>

04:33.155 --> 04:34.156
<i>Hell no…</i>

04:34.198 --> 04:38.698
White Ice! Switch off
deep freeze power now!

04:40.537 --> 04:42.121
Th-The ice…

04:42.414 --> 04:43.540
…melted!

04:45.376 --> 04:46.377
Mista!

04:51.590 --> 04:53.967
The realm of ice is
the realm of stasis!

04:54.009 --> 04:56.761
In cold's piercing embrace,
all creatures settle into inertia!

04:56.845 --> 04:58.429
Ice keeps everything from moving!

04:58.639 --> 05:03.139
White Ice is the paragon
of perfection!

05:03.310 --> 05:07.731
It can still the fury of the sea…
and soon, you'll feel its power!

05:08.440 --> 05:11.651
Come on, pull yourself up, Mista!

05:15.864 --> 05:16.823
Mista!

05:16.865 --> 05:18.741
Grab the grass
floating on the water!

05:18.826 --> 05:20.410
The stuff you used as a snowboard!

05:20.619 --> 05:22.537
Do it now while you can still fire
with your right hand!

05:24.498 --> 05:26.082
Give it up, Mista!

05:26.125 --> 05:29.753
Can't you get it through your head
that your powerless against me?!

05:38.178 --> 05:41.097
So he said grab the grass…
Of course, that's it.

05:41.223 --> 05:44.434
If you withdraw Golden Wind,

05:44.476 --> 05:47.187
the grass will turn back
into car parts.

05:48.439 --> 05:51.942
Then we can shoot them at you
like shrapnel!

05:52.025 --> 05:53.234
What?!

06:01.535 --> 06:02.953
D-Did it work?

06:03.036 --> 06:04.620
Well, not quite.

06:04.663 --> 06:06.665
We're going to be okay for now.

06:06.749 --> 06:07.750
The really good news, Mista,

06:07.791 --> 06:09.292
is that you just bought us
some time!

06:09.376 --> 06:13.129
We can grab what we need
and get the hell out of here.

06:13.255 --> 06:16.633
You can be sure the bastard won't
fall for the same thing twice.

06:16.842 --> 06:19.469
So please listen to me
and go, Mista!

06:19.720 --> 06:23.348
<i>I'll crack that lion like a pinata
and find that disc.</i>

06:23.640 --> 06:25.808
<i>I'll snatch it up
and get hiding fast.</i>

06:25.851 --> 06:27.561
<i>All I need is a few seconds.</i>

06:27.936 --> 06:31.272
<i>But will hiding really be enough
to fool this guy?</i>

06:31.523 --> 06:33.149
<i>Sometimes, I think it'll be enough,</i>

06:33.192 --> 06:35.319
<i>and other times I think,
"who are you kidding, Mista?"</i>

06:35.360 --> 06:38.613
<i>Whatever,
this guy isn't messing around</i>

06:38.655 --> 06:41.157
<i>I don't even want to think about
what would happen</i>

06:41.200 --> 06:43.327
<i>if this stronzo catches up
with Bucciarati and the gang.</i>

06:43.786 --> 06:45.996
That's it,
this guy needs to die now!

06:46.038 --> 06:47.789
Well, there's no time
like the present!

06:48.624 --> 06:50.917
Wha—?! Mista!
What are you doing?!

06:51.126 --> 06:54.462
<i>You think you're unbeatable…
How bout I prove you wrong!</i>

06:54.505 --> 06:57.549
<i>When you completely
cover yourself in ice,</i>

06:57.633 --> 06:59.635
<i>how exactly do you breathe?</i>

07:03.430 --> 07:05.223
<i>That's it… There's no question.</i>

07:05.307 --> 07:06.933
<i>I hear the hiss of air.</i>

07:07.017 --> 07:10.562
<i>That's how he's breathing…
From the back of his neck.</i>

07:11.021 --> 07:13.023
Positions, Six Bullets!

07:13.106 --> 07:16.692
Number One and Number Two,
flank this stronzo!

07:18.487 --> 07:20.947
Wah, he's looking over here!

07:20.989 --> 07:23.574
He's gonna do
that ice thingy again!

07:23.700 --> 07:27.370
<i>No, he's gotta come up
for air first.</i>

07:27.454 --> 07:29.038
<i>Once he surfaces,</i>

07:29.081 --> 07:30.707
<i>I'll blast that blowhole
with some bullets!</i>

07:30.749 --> 07:32.250
Here he comes, guys, get ready!

07:32.501 --> 07:33.877
<i>It's time, Bullets!</i>

07:33.919 --> 07:36.463
<i>The moment he takes a breath!</i>

07:36.672 --> 07:38.173
Mista!

07:38.215 --> 07:41.635
Number One and Two can't find
the breathing hole!

07:43.178 --> 07:46.264
It's the way he's standing…
His head's angled up!

07:46.348 --> 07:47.891
The opening's covered!

07:47.933 --> 07:50.936
Sh-Shit! Retreat!

07:51.019 --> 07:52.353
<i>Pipe down, guys!</i>

07:52.396 --> 07:54.231
<i>Break position,
and forget about any treats,</i>

07:54.273 --> 07:56.149
<i>Number One and Number Two!</i>

07:57.401 --> 07:59.736
You've got some balls
doing that to my forehead!

07:59.820 --> 08:00.821
Mista!

08:06.201 --> 08:07.577
What the—?!

08:07.703 --> 08:09.871
You're trying to shoot the fish?

08:09.913 --> 08:12.540
What dumb idea did ya dream up now?!

08:12.583 --> 08:14.459
He looked down! There it is!

08:14.543 --> 08:15.961
That's it… Blast away!

08:17.254 --> 08:18.255
Here it comes!

08:18.338 --> 08:19.630
We can do this!

08:25.220 --> 08:27.722
- Ce I'abbiamo fatta!
- Ce I'abbiamo fatta!

08:34.146 --> 08:36.314
Th-That sound…

08:36.523 --> 08:39.108
That sound…
There's no way it could be…!

08:39.443 --> 08:43.780
So you figured out how I breathe
and aimed for that, eh?

08:43.864 --> 08:45.657
Mista!

08:45.741 --> 08:48.452
I told you, subzero temperatures
stop everything!

08:48.493 --> 08:52.993
Gases become liquids,
and liquids become solids!

08:53.457 --> 08:56.793
Look a little closer…
See the suspended vapor now?

08:57.002 --> 08:58.420
The bullet, Mista!

08:58.462 --> 09:02.048
You were hearing
a ricocheting bullet!

09:02.424 --> 09:03.508
What?!

09:04.718 --> 09:08.263
White Ice… Gently Weeps!

09:08.305 --> 09:09.306
Mista!

09:09.514 --> 09:12.767
I'd already created
a frozen barrier of vapor!

09:12.809 --> 09:15.019
Sure, it takes a lot of energy
to make it work,

09:15.103 --> 09:19.603
but it protects me from just about
anything, including bolts!

09:19.650 --> 09:22.152
My body is protected by
a barrier of stasis!

09:22.194 --> 09:25.655
I have you to thank for
that little trick, Mista!

09:26.156 --> 09:28.825
Giorno's prediction was right.

09:29.076 --> 09:32.454
This is my doing…
The responsibility is mine.

09:33.080 --> 09:36.500
I knew I should have
gone after that damn disc…

09:37.834 --> 09:40.503
<i>It's not under any trash cans
or benches.</i>

09:40.629 --> 09:42.797
<i>There's nothing around here
that resembles a disc.</i>

09:42.881 --> 09:46.092
<i>Obviously, they wouldn't hide
this thing in plain sight.</i>

09:46.385 --> 09:48.720
<i>Considering how eager Mista
was to get going,</i>

09:48.804 --> 09:52.682
<i>I'm pretty sure the hiding spot
must be pretty close by</i>

09:52.724 --> 09:56.227
<i>Where is it?
The picture should give me a clue…</i>

09:57.688 --> 09:59.606
<i>Merda… This is bad</i>

09:59.648 --> 10:01.941
<i>Mista is at the end of his rope.</i>

10:02.150 --> 10:04.485
<i>He's assuming
responsibility for this</i>

10:04.528 --> 10:05.946
<i>and is laying his life on the line.</i>

10:09.074 --> 10:11.951
<i>But that's exactly
the mindset that will</i>

10:11.994 --> 10:13.912
<i>light up your path when
all you can see is darkness.</i>

10:13.996 --> 10:15.455
<i>This is when
things get interesting.</i>

10:15.664 --> 10:17.624
<i>I've no doubt
there will be sacrifices,</i>

10:17.708 --> 10:19.418
<i>butMista and I
have determinazione.</i>

10:20.043 --> 10:22.545
<i>We will find a way!</i>

10:26.550 --> 10:28.593
GHIACCIO
WHITE ICE

10:29.136 --> 10:30.762
What the hell is this?

10:31.054 --> 10:32.805
They stuck that thing in here?

10:32.848 --> 10:35.433
In a crevice of the statue?

10:35.600 --> 10:38.227
Damn it! I'm at point blank range.

10:38.311 --> 10:42.565
I should be able to take out
his breathing vent and more!

10:42.607 --> 10:45.401
If I can just get close enough
to bypass his little barrier…

10:45.610 --> 10:48.112
Mista's getting desperate.

10:48.196 --> 10:49.739
He's taking responsibility
for all this

10:49.823 --> 10:51.449
and is prepared to pay for it
with his life.

10:51.825 --> 10:54.911
But this isn't simple grit
in the face of desperation.

10:54.953 --> 10:55.954
It's determinazione!

10:56.038 --> 10:57.748
That's what will save us!

10:57.873 --> 11:01.042
Determinazione isn't martyrdom!

11:01.334 --> 11:03.252
A computer disc!

11:03.295 --> 11:06.548
Of course, that's what you guys
were after all along…

11:06.631 --> 11:08.174
A clear path to the boss!

11:08.216 --> 11:09.508
I did it!

11:09.551 --> 11:12.303
The boss's secret identity
won't be so secret anymore!

11:12.429 --> 11:15.765
All that's left now… is Trish!

11:15.891 --> 11:17.976
But first I have to do away
with you idiot as!

11:19.978 --> 11:22.563
Bring it!
I was needing a good laugh!

11:22.606 --> 11:24.357
Then I'll put you
out of your misery!

11:24.399 --> 11:26.401
Mista!

11:34.284 --> 11:36.202
What the hell are you doing?!

11:37.871 --> 11:41.040
Having determinazione
is having the will to

11:41.083 --> 11:43.418
forge your own path in
the shadowy murkiness of life!

11:46.379 --> 11:47.630
<i>Guido Mista:</i>

11:47.672 --> 11:51.008
<i>arrested on allegations
of manslaughter at seventeen.</i>

11:52.094 --> 11:53.428
<i>The outcome of the trial:</i>

11:53.470 --> 11:55.638
<i>self defense plea rejected,</i>

11:55.722 --> 11:59.642
<i>and fifteen to thirty years
in prison.</i>

12:02.938 --> 12:05.774
I was actually happy…

12:05.816 --> 12:07.609
Is this really happening?

12:08.110 --> 12:11.905
<i>Mista had always been able to see
the bright side of things,</i>

12:11.947 --> 12:14.532
<i>but it was the first time in
his life that he was truly scared</i>

12:19.996 --> 12:21.163
Merda.

12:22.499 --> 12:24.000
Get up. You're free.

12:32.676 --> 12:34.344
Were you the one who…?

12:34.469 --> 12:38.969
Yes. I saw your story on the news.
I believe it was self defense.

12:39.516 --> 12:42.143
You've proven you're gun skills
are top notch,

12:42.185 --> 12:45.062
and that your inner strength
is even more formidable.

12:45.147 --> 12:49.647
Besides, a guy like you wouldn't
last two years in prison.

12:50.068 --> 12:50.860
That's why…

12:50.944 --> 12:53.821
You pulled some strings.

12:53.864 --> 12:55.824
You a mafioso?

12:56.658 --> 12:58.242
Come with me.

12:58.326 --> 13:00.745
I know an excellent ristorante.

13:13.925 --> 13:15.718
Now that's how you eat pasta.

13:15.802 --> 13:17.428
You should try the bruschetta.

13:17.512 --> 13:19.305
- Still have some room in there?
- Yeah.

13:19.806 --> 13:20.932
- Mi scusi.
- Si?

13:21.391 --> 13:24.310
Some bruschetta for him…
and I suppose some for them too.

13:24.519 --> 13:26.604
Give me four bruschettas.

13:26.938 --> 13:29.440
No, make it five.

13:29.774 --> 13:31.358
I can't be the lone man out
now can I?

13:32.027 --> 13:33.153
Certainly, signore.

13:33.612 --> 13:35.822
So, as I was saying, I…

13:35.947 --> 13:37.031
I'll do it.

13:37.240 --> 13:39.533
You know, I actually think
we'd make a great team.

13:39.576 --> 13:41.369
That's why I'll do it.

13:41.536 --> 13:42.703
One more thing…

13:42.746 --> 13:44.205
Order me a Dolce, too.

13:44.247 --> 13:46.916
They have torta alle fragole here?

13:48.043 --> 13:50.211
You really are eccentric… odd even.

13:56.051 --> 13:58.011
So this was meant to be, too.

13:58.720 --> 14:01.723
Guess things could be worse.
Everything turned out pretty okay.

14:02.057 --> 14:05.727
<i>Mista came to the realization
that each and every one of us</i>

14:05.769 --> 14:06.895
<i>has a unique destiny</i>

14:07.562 --> 14:08.813
<i>Youth maybe difficult,</i>

14:08.897 --> 14:12.817
<i>a painful period of seemingly
endless hurdles and setbacks,</i>

14:12.901 --> 14:16.946
<i>but in the end, we all travel down
the path we are supposed to take.</i>

14:18.907 --> 14:21.826
<i>I see it…
I see the path plain as day!</i>

14:22.202 --> 14:24.621
<i>I finally see it. It's right there!</i>

14:24.704 --> 14:26.706
It's there, Giorno!

14:26.748 --> 14:30.418
Through the shadowy murkiness,
I see the path!

14:34.464 --> 14:36.757
- Yeehaw!
- Yeehaw!

14:45.141 --> 14:48.686
You fellas just don't have a clue.

14:50.105 --> 14:53.316
Subzero temperatures
freeze the vapor.

14:53.441 --> 14:54.942
Something like this.

14:54.985 --> 14:57.821
If I take a frozen mass of vapor

14:57.862 --> 15:00.239
and stick it in my suit
to melt down,

15:00.282 --> 15:02.158
the vapor returns to
its original state!

15:02.200 --> 15:04.035
So when I take in
the stuff like that…

15:04.869 --> 15:07.413
I'm like a diver with a scuba tank.

15:07.497 --> 15:10.333
I don't need a breathing vent
now do I?!

15:10.458 --> 15:11.584
The vent!

15:11.626 --> 15:13.544
He deflected the bullets!

15:13.628 --> 15:15.713
Six of them! O-Oh, no!

15:15.964 --> 15:20.464
But you have all that
determinazione, right, Mista?!

15:26.474 --> 15:27.766
Say your goodbyes.

15:27.976 --> 15:31.396
<i>Yeah, I've got determinzaione
all right, Giorno.</i>

15:31.479 --> 15:33.355
<i>If you hadn't given me yours,</i>

15:33.398 --> 15:35.483
<i>I would have never
discovered my path.</i>

15:35.650 --> 15:40.150
<i>The enlightened path to shooting
myself with my own bullets…</i>

15:44.159 --> 15:45.743
I-I can't see!

15:45.827 --> 15:47.870
The blood's stuck to me…
It's congealed…

15:47.871 --> 15:49.956
That path wasn't
gonna reveal itself

15:49.998 --> 15:54.168
by blasting my bullets through
that protective ice wall.

15:54.210 --> 15:56.962
No, the path to enlightenment
was illuminated

15:57.005 --> 15:58.464
with a splash of blood to the face!

15:58.506 --> 16:00.841
Shit! I can't get it off!

16:04.429 --> 16:06.431
Hey, there's that metal pole!

16:06.514 --> 16:09.350
Mista, your bullet
carved it into a—

16:11.353 --> 16:13.188
Ow! That hurts!

16:13.229 --> 16:17.729
Something… Something…
Something… Something lukewarm is—

16:18.526 --> 16:22.238
You asked if I had determinazione…

16:22.739 --> 16:25.533
So I'm gonna show you
what it's all about!

16:25.575 --> 16:28.077
But if I show you mine,
you got to show me yours.

16:28.161 --> 16:30.413
The determinazione, that is,

16:30.455 --> 16:33.791
to be shot to
the frozen version of hell!

16:33.875 --> 16:36.335
<i>How is that bastardo
still upright?!</i>

16:36.419 --> 16:39.380
<i>And he's trying to shove me
back even more!</i>

16:39.672 --> 16:42.091
<i>He's certifiably insane…
He's gonna kill me!</i>

16:42.217 --> 16:44.844
Merda… I gotta yank this thing out!

16:50.016 --> 16:52.268
You're crazy!
The bullet's gonna come right back!

16:52.352 --> 16:54.062
You're not gonna last!

16:54.187 --> 16:55.771
I don't have a choice.

16:55.855 --> 16:57.898
True determinazione starts now!

16:57.941 --> 17:00.443
Bullets, buckle up,
and hold on tight!

17:06.241 --> 17:09.410
White Ice… Gently Weeps!

17:18.628 --> 17:20.379
It's too much, Mista!

17:20.422 --> 17:22.757
You're gonna pass out!

17:22.841 --> 17:24.467
Not to mention us…

17:24.551 --> 17:25.802
We're gonna fade away!

17:25.885 --> 17:27.386
N-Not yet!

17:27.429 --> 17:31.433
I'm still alive and kicking…
I can still pull the trigger!

17:35.979 --> 17:37.480
Hole in one!

17:37.522 --> 17:40.107
You got him good!

17:40.525 --> 17:42.193
You're… wrong…

17:43.445 --> 17:47.945
You may have determinazione…
but I've got more…

17:48.575 --> 17:50.952
Guido Mista…

17:51.119 --> 17:54.622
I have to say… you dole out
some major damage…

17:54.664 --> 17:57.208
Kudos to you, amico…

17:57.292 --> 18:01.792
But losing all that blood was
really to my advantage!

18:02.464 --> 18:06.593
I froze the red stuff and created
my own icy support!

18:06.634 --> 18:09.678
It keeps that pesky pointed thing
from sinking further into my neck!

18:09.721 --> 18:10.930
I'm doing just fine!

18:10.972 --> 18:13.849
Your stupid spike
ain't going anywhere!

18:13.975 --> 18:16.644
Oh yeah, did you forget?

18:16.644 --> 18:19.188
Your final bullet is still…

18:21.274 --> 18:22.525
…lodged in your skull!

18:22.609 --> 18:23.610
I win!

18:25.487 --> 18:27.071
There's no wound?!

18:31.409 --> 18:32.618
Wha—?!

18:35.580 --> 18:36.706
Mista…

18:38.333 --> 18:39.959
Your determinazione,

18:40.001 --> 18:44.501
shines brighter than
the morning sun.

18:45.548 --> 18:48.342
It showed us the way today…

18:48.843 --> 18:50.261
…and it will show us
the way tomorrow!

18:50.345 --> 18:53.765
What the hell?!

18:54.349 --> 18:58.849
Muda, muda muda muda muda!

19:11.908 --> 19:14.869
<i>You know… I'm starting to notice…</i>

19:14.911 --> 19:17.038
<i>this Giorno Giovanna…</i>

19:17.121 --> 19:18.747
<i>this complete rookie…</i>

19:18.915 --> 19:21.667
<i>eventually, sooner or later…</i>

19:22.043 --> 19:25.129
<i>he says things,
and the things happen.</i>

19:25.630 --> 19:29.467
<i>My determinazione
was really Giorno's.</i>

19:29.551 --> 19:33.096
<i>Subconsciously,
it flooded my being.</i>

19:33.221 --> 19:37.141
<i>It's like he superseded Bucciarati
to become capo,</i>

19:37.225 --> 19:38.517
<i>like he was guiding my every move.</i>

19:39.394 --> 19:41.687
<i>How the hell does he do that?</i>

19:41.771 --> 19:43.689
<i>Guess it doesn't matter.</i>

19:43.731 --> 19:46.400
<i>Not like obsessing over it
is gonna do me any good</i>

19:49.737 --> 19:53.282
Mista, we got the disc,
safe and sound…

19:53.324 --> 19:54.867
You really made it happen.

19:55.034 --> 19:58.662
Heal me fast. I-I can't breathe…

19:58.746 --> 20:03.246
I was only able to do it because
I knew you could fix me afterwards.

20:03.418 --> 20:05.670
Come on,
before I bite the dust for good…

20:05.753 --> 20:07.004
Just fix me…

20:07.463 --> 20:08.714
No need to worry.

20:08.756 --> 20:11.717
But first,
I should probably clarify.

20:11.801 --> 20:15.971
Technically Golden Wind
doesn't fix things.

20:16.014 --> 20:17.932
In your case, it will make
a component of your body.

20:18.141 --> 20:20.101
I'll imbue the bullets embedded
in your body with life,

20:20.143 --> 20:22.478
thereby replacing your damaged
blood vessels and tissue.

20:22.562 --> 20:24.313
Fine, sounds great,
just start imbuing.

20:24.647 --> 20:26.190
I should also mention that,

20:26.274 --> 20:28.526
since I'm not really healing you,
you will have some residual pain.

20:28.610 --> 20:30.612
I just want to make sure
you know this now.

20:32.071 --> 20:32.863
Ow!

20:32.947 --> 20:37.447
O-Ow! Do you have to be so rough.
Shit, be a little gentler, Giorno!

20:38.494 --> 20:40.621
I told you,
there's nothing I can do.

20:40.663 --> 20:42.915
Come on, you're a mafioso,
settle down.

20:43.207 --> 20:45.125
Besides, you have about
eighteen more to go,

20:45.168 --> 20:46.794
and you're going to have to
take off those clothes

20:46.836 --> 20:47.920
if you want this to work.

20:51.716 --> 20:54.677
Bucciarati!
I'm picking up two people…

20:54.761 --> 20:56.763
It doesn't look like
there's anyone else.

20:56.929 --> 20:58.347
Proceed with caution.

20:58.848 --> 21:01.809
I would guess you've found
Mista and Giorno.

21:01.851 --> 21:03.018
I'm sure the lack of excitement

21:03.102 --> 21:05.521
has them looking forward
to our return.

21:05.563 --> 21:06.981
Ack! Giorno!

21:07.023 --> 21:09.191
There they are! Hey, Mista! Gio—

21:09.233 --> 21:10.859
Not so hard… Gentle, gentle!

21:11.069 --> 21:13.488
Don't take off my clothes…
It's too intense!

21:16.616 --> 21:18.951
Well, Narancia? Did you find them?

21:18.993 --> 21:22.162
Huh? W-Well, u-um…

21:22.330 --> 21:25.833
No! Huh?! I got something
stuck in my eye now.

21:25.875 --> 21:27.960
- I can't see!
- Giorno, no! Don't!

21:28.002 --> 21:30.295
- I can't tell whether it's really them!
- I can't take much more of this!

21:30.338 --> 21:33.591
Not so hard, merda!

23:08.436 --> 23:11.272
RISOTTO'S WHEREABOUTS UNKNOWN.
CURRENTLY SEARCHING
AIRPORTS, TRAIN STATIONS,
ALONG WITH NAPOLI AND ITS ENVIRONS.

23:09.604 --> 23:11.293
Risotto, you bastard…

23:12.315 --> 23:15.151
So you're coming to Venezia.

23:20.156 --> 23:23.784
I'm sure Bucciarati and his men
will take care of you swiftly.

23:23.826 --> 23:27.120
Come what may, peace is at hand.

23:38.424 --> 23:42.094
EPISODE 20
THE FINAL MISSION FROM THE BOSS
